        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Canonical `organization` Node\n\nThe canonical node answers:\n\n> What organization is this?\n\nSuggested fields:\n\n- Official name\n- Common name\n- Acronym\n- Organization type\n- Short description\n- Founded date\n- Dissolved date, when applicable\n- Legal status\n- Website\n- Headquarters\n- Geographic scope\n- Logo or primary image\n\nSuggested organization kinds:\n\n- Company\n- Government\n- Government agency\n- Nonprofit\n- Political organization\n- University\n- Military organization\n- Religious organization\n- Foundation\n- Open-source project\n- Informal association\n\nLeadership, products, subsidiaries, members, and events should not be embedded as large arrays in this node.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
