      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# New Class: `organizational-unit`\n\nRepresents a recognized internal component of an organization.\n\n## Suggested kinds\n\n- Department\n- Division\n- Branch\n- Chapter\n- Agency\n- Committee\n- Office\n- Subsidiary\n- Program unit\n\n## Suggested fields\n\n- Name\n- Unit kind\n- Description\n- Parent organization or parent unit\n- Founded date\n- Dissolved date\n- Location\n- Active status\n\nThis class allows the same template to describe a small company, a university, a global nonprofit, or a large government without flattening internal structure into prose.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784473618170,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
