        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Declared Surfaces\n\nThe Organization Template should mirror the Person Template's three-surface contract.\n\n## Profile\n\nPublic overview containing identity, description, founding information, headquarters, mission, major leaders, offerings, and important relationships.\n\n## Research\n\nClaims, evidence, sources, quotations, major events, contested information, and sourced relationships.\n\n## Icon\n\nCompact collection-facing representation containing logo, short name, organization kind, and a brief descriptor.\n\nSuggested IDs:\n\n- `organization-profile-surface`\n- `organization-research-surface`\n- `organization-icon-surface`\n\nThe Profile surface should be the default.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784473618170,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
