          }
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Initial Dependency Vocabulary\n\nRecommended first implementation:\n\n`text\ndeclaration\nport\norganization\naffiliation\norganizational-unit\nrole\nlife-event\nrelationship\nwork\nmedia\nclaim\nevidence\nsource\nquote\n`\n\nDeferred extension points:\n\n`text\nplace\noffering\n`\n\nThe goal is a small reusable grammar, not an encyclopedia of organization-related node types.\n\nEvery class included in the template should either already exist or be accompanied by a node-class graph and bridge declaration.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784473618170,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
