      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Validation Cases\n\nTest the template against organizations with substantially different structures.\n\n## OpenAI\n\nTests company identity, leadership, products, research, partnerships, and publications.\n\n## Turning Point USA\n\nTests nonprofit identity, chapters, political activity, leadership, campaigns, and affiliations.\n\n## United States Federal Government\n\nTests large hierarchical structure, agencies, offices, branches, roles, legal authority, and long-lived institutional history.\n\nThe template succeeds when all three can be represented without either:\n\n1. reducing everything to generic relationship soup, or\n2. requiring a different template for every organization category.\n\n## Hostile edge cases\n\n- A dissolved organization\n- A renamed or merged organization\n- A loosely organized movement without clear legal identity\n- A multinational parent with subsidiaries and regional units",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784473618170,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
