      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Suggested Codex Implementation Plan\n\n1. Duplicate the structural skeleton of `person-template.node`.\n2. Rename declaration identity and surfaces for Organization.\n3. Replace the canonical `person` node with an `organization` node.\n4. Preserve bridges for reusable research classes.\n5. Create node-class graphs for:\n   - `organization`\n   - `affiliation`\n   - `organizational-unit`\n6. Decide whether `offering` is required for version 1 or deferred.\n7. Create Profile, Research, and Icon surfaces.\n8. Add lightweight placeholder examples demonstrating:\n   - one leader affiliation\n   - one organizational unit\n   - one life event\n   - one organization relationship\n   - one sourced claim\n9. Validate all bridge refs, class bindings, surface IDs, node IDs, and declaration dependencies.\n10. Instantiate one real organization graph from the finished template before treating the schema as stable.\n\n## Proposed location\n\n`github://mikemartinez1974/public/organizations/template/organization-template.node`\n\nThe first implementation should prioritize architectural compatibility with the Person Template over completeness.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784473618170,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    }
